      "t": "Refusing to visit the agency while his father Mathias is there, Hippolyte asks Camille to meet him at a cafe. Sitting outside on a cold Paris afternoon, the two half-siblings sign contracts, talk about their shared father, and invent a warm new friendship. Let's listen to the scene in French first.",
