    {
      "v": "hippolyte",
      "t": "Mon père est là?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is my father there?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "Oui.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "hippolyte",
      "t": "Je ne viens pas, alors. Je ne veux pas le voir.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not coming, then. I do not want to see him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "On peut se retrouver ailleurs?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Can we meet somewhere else?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "hippolyte",
      "t": "Salut!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hi!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "Un café, s'il vous plaît.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A coffee, please.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "serveur",
      "t": "D'accord.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "hippolyte",
      "t": "Il a soudainement fait froid. C'est l'enfer en scooter.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It suddenly got cold. It is hell on a scooter.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "Il gèle à vélo. Je pédale comme une folle!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is freezing on a bike. I pedal like crazy!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "Voici tes contrats.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here are your contracts.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "Je suis désolée.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am sorry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "hippolyte",
      "t": "C'est mon père qui devrait s'excuser, pas toi.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My father is the one who should apologize, not you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "Notre père! C'est trop bizarre.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our father! It is so weird.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "hippolyte",
      "t": "On va juste oublier ça et devenir amis.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are just going to forget about that and become friends.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "hippolyte",
      "t": "Tu es ma sœpote et je suis ton frote!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
